  "question": {
    "text": "A small speaker delivers <math><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math> of audio output. At what distance from the speaker will one detect <math><mn>120</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> intensity sound? [Given reference intensity&nbsp;of sound as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> ]"
  },
